!Series_summary = CRISPR/Cas9 screens identified unexpected hits in human AML cell lines whose loss of function causes resistance to SHP2 inhibition.
!Series_overall_design = Transcriptomic analysis of INPPL1, or MAP4K5 KO compared with parental MOLM13 cells either under SHP099 treatment or Ctrl (DMSO) to identify key pathways causing resistance.
